<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Faulding half year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Faulding half year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   26.99  vs  23.54</p>
<p>    Net				    16.21  vs  12.40</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    9.0   vs   9.00</p>
<p>NOTE: F.H. Faulding and Co Ltd is a pharmaceutical manufacturer and wholesaler.</p>
</text>
